WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:01.440
- Let's finish out strong

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:04.440
with a story I hope will warm your heart.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.756
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:09.840
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.930
A PE coach in Portland,
Oregon is making sure

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:15.810
kids at his school get to
feel the joy and freedom

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.310
of riding their bikes.

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:19.950
He started what he calls a bike bus.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.410
Once a week, a hundred plus
kids take over the streets

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:24.573
riding their bicycles to school.

00:00:25.994 --> 00:00:29.077
(upbeat funky music)

00:00:40.054 --> 00:00:41.850
(audience applauds)

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:43.680
Looks awesome, right?

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:46.710
We have this fearless leader
and educator on the line now

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:49.053
watching on Fox 12 Oregon at three.

00:00:50.141 --> 00:00:50.974
Hi!

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:54.291
Hi, Coach Balto.

00:00:54.291 --> 00:00:56.850
Happy to have you.

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.205
So how did you come up with it?

00:00:59.205 --> 00:01:01.263
- So as a physical education teacher,

00:01:01.263 --> 00:01:04.200
I've always been passionate
about finding ways

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.420
for children to be physically active,

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:08.640
and children walking and biking to school

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:10.950
is a great way to build physical activity

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:12.540
into their schedule.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:15.930
I saw videos in Barcelona
and in San Francisco

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:17.910
of bike buses last school year.

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:20.700
So I organized bike bus for Earth Day.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:22.140
It was a huge success.

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:23.220
They love it so much.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:25.170
They're asking for bikes
for their birthday,

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:27.990
and they're even biking
on non bike bus days.

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:30.711
It's absolutely incredible to see.

00:01:30.711 --> 00:01:31.713
- I love it.

00:01:31.713 --> 00:01:33.056
It's really powerful,

00:01:33.056 --> 00:01:36.540
and you do them every
week, right, without fail?

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:39.634
- Every week rain or
shine every Wednesday.

00:01:39.634 --> 00:01:42.834
We have two routes a mile
and a half from each other,

00:01:42.834 --> 00:01:45.390
and then they meet a mile from the school,

00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:47.211
and that's where the fun really takes off.

00:01:47.211 --> 00:01:50.546
We have a group of
awesome parent volunteers

00:01:50.546 --> 00:01:53.794
who join us and ride to
make sure everybody's safe,

00:01:53.794 --> 00:01:57.390
and neighbors come out and
they cheer the students

00:01:57.390 --> 00:02:00.660
when they ride by while
we're blasting fun music.

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:04.320
Children now more than ever
are craving social connection.

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:07.080
and this is a great way
to get the kids active.

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:08.730
And the great thing about this,

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:11.310
this is a movement anybody can create

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:12.416
in their school community.

00:02:12.416 --> 00:02:14.851
Find another family to ride bikes with,

00:02:14.851 --> 00:02:18.274
organize a bike bus, share
it with other people.

00:02:18.274 --> 00:02:20.880
Even if it's a two block ride,

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:25.680
it's a great time and you'll
see the joy that bikes create.

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:27.330
- Love it.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:29.550
Thanks for being an
amazing community leader.

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:32.130
Thank you so much, Coach Balto.

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:34.803
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:38.340
That's not all.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.590
Kelly's season long partner Pilot Pen,

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:43.350
makers of Frixion, the go-to erasable pen

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:45.150
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show,"

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:47.040
want to celebrate educators like you

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:48.660
giving their all to their students.

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:52.847
So they're giving Alameda
Elementary PTA $1,000.

00:02:54.085 --> 00:02:57.720
(audience applauds)

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:58.650
Amazing.

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.467
- Amazing. Thank you so much.
- Thank you.

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:06.420
Thank you so much to all our guests today.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:09.569
Ryan Reynolds, Will Ferrell,
and Octavia Spencer,

00:03:09.569 --> 00:03:12.420
and Angela Bassett.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:15.060
As Kelly always says, have a great day.

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:17.133
And if it's not, change it.

